{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_1","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"諸王世表五","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_2","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"英宗九子。憲宗外，庶三子見湜未封，殤。其得封者七王，曰德莊王見潾，曰許悼王見淳，曰秀懷王見澍，曰崇簡王見澤，曰吉簡王見浚，曰忻穆王見治，曰徽莊王見沛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_3","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"莊王見潾，英宗庶二子，天順元年封。成化三年就藩濟南府。正德十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_4","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"懿王祐榕，莊嫡二子，正德十六年襲封。嘉靖十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_5","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"厚燉，懿庶二子，初封東平王，嘉靖中改封世子。未幾卒。以子載墱襲封，追封王，諡曰懷。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_6","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"恭王載墱，懷庶二子，嘉靖二十年襲封。萬曆二年薨。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_7","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"定王翊錧，恭嫡一子，萬曆五年襲封。十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_8","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王常〈潔，糸改青〉，定嫡一子，萬曆十九年襲封。崇禎五年薨。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_9","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"由〈木氧，羊改工〉，常〈潔，糸改青〉庶一子，初封廣宗王，萬曆四十三年改封世子。未襲，卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_10","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王由樞，常〈潔，糸改青〉庶二子，初封郡王，崇禎中進封。十二年正月，大清兵克濟南，見執。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_11","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"泰安","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_12","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"恭簡王祐樬，莊庶一子，成化十六年封。嘉靖十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_13","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"端懿王厚燌，恭簡庶一子，嘉靖十六年襲封。二十五年薨。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_14","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"康惠王載〈土座〉，端懿庶一子，嘉靖三十八年襲封。三十九年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_15","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"濟寧","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_16","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"安僖王祐樳，莊庶三子，成化十七年封。正德七年薨。子五人俱殀，絕，除。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_17","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"歷城","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_18","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"榮和王厚〈火節〉，懿庶三子，嘉靖二年封。七年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_19","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"臨朐","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_20","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"榮簡王厚燨，懿庶七子，嘉靖十五年封。二十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_21","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"懷莊王載堠，榮簡嫡一子，嘉靖三十六年襲封。四十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_22","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王翊鈝，懷莊嫡一子，隆慶六年襲封。萬曆三十七年薨。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_23","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王常湸，翊鈝嫡一子，萬曆三十三年封長子，旣而襲封。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_24","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"高唐","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_25","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"悼僖王厚〈火爾〉，懿庶八子，嘉靖二十二年封。二十六年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_26","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"臨清","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_27","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"溫懿王載塐，懷庶三子，嘉靖二十二年封。萬曆二年薨。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_28","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"僖順王翊鋑，溫懿嫡一子，萬曆五年襲封。三十年薨。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_29","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王常瀝，僖順嫡一子，萬曆十二年封長子。三十八年襲封。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_30","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"寧海","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_31","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"恭和王載〈土予〉，懷嫡四子，嘉靖二十二年封。隆慶三年薨。","sentenceOrder":31}