4","textTraditional":"□□王由喿，昭裕庶一子，萬曆四十二年襲封。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_49","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"永年","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_50","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王由楙，常〈潔，糸改青〉庶八子，萬曆四十二年封，薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_51","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"寧陽","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_52","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王由椅，常〈潔，糸改青〉庶九子，萬曆四十五年封。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_53","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"悼王見淳，英宗庶四子，景泰三年封，未就藩，薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_54","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"懷王見澍，英宗庶五子，天順元年封。成化六年就藩汝寧府。八年薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_55","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"簡王見澤，英宗嫡六子，天順元年封。成化十年就藩汝寧府。弘治十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_56","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"靖王祐樒，簡嫡一子，正德三年襲封。六年薨。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_57","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"恭王厚燿，靖嫡一子，正德九年襲封。嘉靖十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_58","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"莊王載境，恭嫡一子，嘉靖十八年襲封。三十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_59","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"端王翊〈金爵〉，莊嫡一子，嘉靖三十七年襲封。萬曆三十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_60","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"常〈捷，扌改氵〉，端庶一子，萬曆元年封泰和王。六年改封世子。十一年未襲薨。無子。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_61","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"常〈氵{水聿}〉，端庶二子，萬曆九年封南陽王，十四年改封世子，三十年未襲薨。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_62","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王由樻，常〈氵{水聿}〉庶一子，萬曆四十年襲封。崇禎十五年閏十一月，闖賊陷汝寧，王及世子慈煇俱被執。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_63","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTradi