xtTraditional":"□□王載堭，莊庶六子，嘉靖二十六年封。隆慶六年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":298},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_299","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"壽張","sentenceOrder":299},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_300","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王載〈土鼎〉，莊庶七子，嘉靖二十九年封。三十四年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":300},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_301","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"商河","sentenceOrder":301},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_302","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"康順王載塨，莊庶八子，嘉靖三十五年封。萬曆二十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":302},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_303","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王翊〈瓊，王改金〉，康順嫡一子，萬曆二年封長子。二十五年襲封。四十四年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":303},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_304","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"靖王祐橒，憲宗嫡八子，成化二十三年封。弘治十二年就藩衡州府。正德二年薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":304},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_305","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"定王祐榰，憲宗庶九子，弘治四年封。十一年就藩保寧府。十七年移德安府。嘉靖二十四年薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":305},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_306","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"安王祐梈，憲宗庶十一子，弘治四年封。十四年就藩衞輝府。嘉靖二十年薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":306},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_307","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"簡王祐橓，憲宗庶十二子，弘治四年封。十五年就藩沂州。嘉靖十六年薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":307},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_308","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"莊王祐樞，憲宗庶十三子，弘治四年封。正德三年就藩常德府。嘉靖十八年薨。","sentenceOrder":308},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_309","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"厚〈火〈熏力〉〉，莊嫡一子，正德十年封世子。嘉靖十一年薨。以子載墐襲封。追封王，諡曰懷。","sentenceOrder":309},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_310","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"恭王載墐，懷嫡一子，嘉靖十九年襲封。萬曆二十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":310},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_311","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王翊鉁，恭嫡一子，萬曆二十六年襲封。四十年薨。","sentenceOrder":311},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_312","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王常溒，翊鉁嫡一子，萬曆九年封長孫。二十六年改封世子。四十二年襲封，薨。","sentenceOrder":312},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_313","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"憲王由枵，常溒嫡二子，萬曆三十年封世孫。四十四年改封世子，旣而襲封。","sentenceOrder":313},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_314","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"福寧","sentenceOrder":314},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_315","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"懷僖王厚熹，莊嫡二子，正德十年封。嘉靖十四年薨。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":315},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_316","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"惠安","sentenceOrder":316},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_317","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"康和王厚煦，莊嫡三子，嘉靖元年封，二十三年薨。","sentenceOrder":317},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_318","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"宣懿王載塾，康和嫡一子，嘉靖二十七年襲封。四十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":318},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_319","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王翊鏕，宣懿庶一子，隆慶六年襲封。萬曆四十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":319},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_320","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"永春","sentenceOrder":320},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_321","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"榮簡王厚烮，莊庶四子，嘉靖八年封。萬曆十六年薨。","sentenceOrder":321},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_322","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"載垍，榮簡庶一子，隆慶五年封長子。萬曆十六年卒。無子，除。","sentenceOrder":322},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_323","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"富城","sentenceOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_324","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"康定王厚然，莊庶五子，嘉靖十年封。萬曆四年薨。","sentenceOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_325","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王載壔，康定嫡一子，嘉靖二十八年封長子。萬曆七年襲封。三十九年薨。","sentenceOrder":325},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_326","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王翊〈金蝱〉，載壔庶一子，萬曆十六年封長子。四十三年襲封。","sentenceOrder":326},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_327","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"貴溪","sentenceOrder":327},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_328","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"端靖王厚〈火曾〉，莊庶六子，嘉靖十年封。萬曆九年薨。","sentenceOrder":328},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_329","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"載堺，端靖嫡一子，嘉靖二十九年封長子。三十一年卒。無子。","sentenceOrder":329},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_330","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王載〈土瓦〉，端靖嫡三子，萬曆三十三年以鎮國將軍進封。","sentenceOrder":330},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_331","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"肇慶","sentenceOrder":331},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_332","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王由楨，常溒嫡五子，天啟六年封。","sentenceOrder":332},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_333","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"懿王祐楷，憲宗庶十四子，弘治四年封，建邸敍州府。十六年未就藩，薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":333},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_334","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"世宗八子。穆宗外，哀沖、莊敬二太子及他皇子俱殤。其得封者一王，曰景恭王載圳。","sentenceOrder":334},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_335","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"恭王載圳，世宗庶四子，嘉靖十八年封。四十年就藩德安府。四十四年薨。無子，封除。","sentenceOrder":335},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_336","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"穆宗四子。神宗外，憲懷太子及他皇子殤。其得封者一王，曰潞簡王翊鏐。","sentenceOrder":336},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_337","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"簡王翊鏐，穆宗嫡四子，隆慶五年封。萬曆十七年就藩衞輝府。四十二年薨。","sentenceOrder":337},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_338","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王常淓，簡庶一子，萬曆四十六年襲封。後以國亡，寓杭州。大清順治二年六月，王師至，遂降。","sentenceOrder":338},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_339","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"寶豐","sentenceOrder":339},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_340","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王常〈氵坒〉，簡庶二子，天啟三年封。","sentenceOrder":340},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_341","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"神宗八子。光宗外，三子未封。其得封者四王，曰福恭王常洵，曰瑞王常浩，曰惠王常潤，曰桂端王常瀛。","sentenceOrder":341},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_342","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"恭王常洵，神宗庶三子，萬曆二十九年封。四十二年就藩河南府。崇禎十四年正月，闖賊陷洛陽，遇害。","sentenceOrder":342},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_343","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"由崧，恭庶一子，萬曆四十五年封德昌王。崇禎十六年襲封。十七年，闖賊陷京師，五月自立於南京，僭號弘光。大清順治二年五月，王師渡江，被執。","sentenceOrder":343},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_344","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"潁上","sentenceOrder":344},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_345","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□□王由榘，恭庶二子，萬曆中封。崇禎十四年正月與恭王同遇害。","sentenceOrder":345},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_346","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王常浩，神宗庶五子，萬曆二十九年封。天啟七年就藩漢中府。崇禎十七年，張獻忠陷重慶，遇害。","sentenceOrder":346},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_347","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"□王常潤，神宗庶六子，萬曆二十九年封。天啟七年就藩荊州府。崇禎末，奔廣州府。大清順治三年，廣東平，被執，死。","sentenceOrder":347},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_348","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"端王常瀛，神宗庶七子，萬曆二十九年封。天啟七年就藩衡州府。崇禎十六年，獻賊陷衡州，王由永州入廣西，寄居蒼梧。十七年薨。","sentenceOrder":348},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_349","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"由〈木愛〉，端嫡三子，初封安仁王。唐王聿鍵自立，偽封為桂王。大清順治三年，卒於梧州。無子。","sentenceOrder":349},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_350","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"由榔，端嫡四子，初封永明王。大清順治三年，福建平，由榔自立於肇慶，僭號永曆。是冬，王師度嶺，由榔走廣西，自是走貴州，又走雲南，遂入緬甸。十八年冬，王師至，緬人獻之。明年，殺諸雲南。","sentenceOrder":350},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_351","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"莊烈帝七子。獻愍太子慈烺外，嫡第二子，庶第五子、第六子、第七子俱殤。其封而未建藩邸者二王，曰定哀王慈炯，曰永悼王慈炤。","sentenceOrder":351},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_352","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"哀王慈炯，莊烈帝嫡三子，崇禎十四年封，未建藩邸。十七年，闖賊陷京師，被執，不知所終。","sentenceOrder":352},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_104_353","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_104","textTraditional":"悼王慈炤，莊烈帝庶四子，崇禎十五年封，未建藩邸。十七年，闖賊陷京師，被執，不知所終。","sentenceOrder":353}],"overrides":{}}